  "contentHtml": "<P>수업시간 애들과 같은 잔소리와 싸우기 싫어서 만들어 사용합니다.<BR>교과 오리엔테이션때&nbsp; 아이들에게 프린트해서&nbsp;나누어주고 </P>\r\n<P>교과서 겉장 안쪽면에 붙여 놓으라 하니 일년동안 잔소리 할일들이 적어지더라고요,,<BR>필요하시면 적당히 변경하여 사용해 보세요.</P>\r\n<P><BR><!--StartFragment--></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: center; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">과학시간에 이런 것은 꼭 지켜야 행복합니다</SPAN><SPAN  style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\">&nbsp; </SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN  style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">1. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">수업 준비는 꼭 해 와야 합니다</SPAN><SPAN  style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN  style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"></SPAN><SPAN  style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">- </SPAN><U style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">교과서</SPAN></U><U style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><SPAN  style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">, </SPAN></U><U style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">수업 프린트 철 등 수업 준비물</SPAN></U></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\">&nbsp; </SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN  style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">2. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">수업 종이 나면 주변 쓰레기를 치우과 자리에 앉아 책을 펴 놓고 </SPAN><U style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">오늘 배울</SPAN></U><SPAN  style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"> </SPAN><U style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">부분을 읽고</SPAN></U><SPAN  style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"> </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">있어야 합니다</SPAN><SPAN  style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN  style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">&nbsp;- 주변에 떨어진 쓰레기는 쓰레기로부터 가까운 사람이 주인입니다.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN  style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN  style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"></SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN  style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">3. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">수업 중 질문은 반드시 </SPAN><U style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">손을 들고</SPAN></U><SPAN  style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"> </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">해야 합니다</SPAN><SPAN  style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\">&nbsp; </SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN  style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">4. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">조별 수업 시 분담된 역할을 하지 않으면 </SPAN><U style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">결과 반영 시</SPAN></U><SPAN  style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"> </SPAN><U style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">영점처리될 수도 있습니다.</SPAN></U><SPAN  style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\"> </SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\">&nbsp; </SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN  style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">5. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">동일한 일로 세 번 이상 지적될 시 </SPAN><U style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">교사를 행복하게</SPAN></U><SPAN  style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"> </SPAN><U style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">하지 않은 죄</SPAN></U><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">를 물어 수행 평가에 엄청난 불이익이 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">돌아갑니다</SPAN><SPAN  style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\">&nbsp; </SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN  style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">6. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">수업시간에 떠들다가 걸리면 </SPAN><U style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">교사로부터 가까운 사람이 </SPAN></U><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">교사에게 불이익을 받습니다</SPAN><SPAN  style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\">&nbsp; </SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><SPAN  style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">7. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">나머지는 그 때 그 때마다 따로 결정합니다</SPAN><SPAN  style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴바탕\">&nbsp; </SPAN></P>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
